  "id": "sit_002",
  "kind": "process",
  "title": "Unstick a delayed US visa",
  "summary": "You cannot force a stuck visa, only push. First find where it is stuck: CEAC for the consulate, the USCIS case tracker for the petition. With 221(g) administrative processing, know what you are in: no fixed timeline, no appeal. Most cases resolve; some take months. Your moves: a documented expedite request against USCIS's published criteria, Form I-907 premium processing if your petition type qualifies (it does nothing for a consular 221(g)), immigration counsel, and a congressional inquiry with your signed privacy release. Plan B: run the company remotely while you wait. Educational guidance, not legal advice. CEAC and the USCIS tracker sit behind bot walls, so status checks are done by hand, not API.",
